{"key":"apcalcab-mcq-028","kind":"mcq","model":"google/gemini-3.8-flash","pass":"solve","ok":true,"object":{"chosen_label":"D","final_answer":"If a function is differentiable at x=a, then it is continuous there.","working":"A fundamental theorem of calculus states that differentiability implies continuity: if f is differentiable at x=a, then lim_{x->a} [f(x) - f(a)] = lim_{x->a} [(f(x) - f(a))/(x - a) * (x - a)] = f'(a) * 0 = 0, which means lim_{x->a} f(x) = f(a), proving continuity at x=a. Thus, D is always true.\n\nCounterexamples for others:\nA: f(x) = |x| is continuous at x=0 but not differentiable there.\nB: f(x) = x^3 has f'(0) = 0, but x=0 is not a local extremum.\nC: Differentiability strictly implies continuity, so a function cannot be differentiable where discontinuous.","defect":""},"usage":{"inputTokens":391,"inputTokenDetails":{"noCacheTokens":391,"cacheReadTokens":0},"outputTokens":501,"outputTokenDetails":{"textTokens":236,"reasoningTokens":265},"totalTokens":892,"raw":{"thoughtsTokenCount":265,"promptTokenCount":391,"candidatesTokenCount":236,"totalTokenCount":892,"trafficType":"ON_DEMAND","promptTokensDetails":[{"modality":"TEXT","tokenCount":391}],"candidatesTokensDetails":[{"modality":"TEXT","tokenCount":236}]},"reasoningTokens":265,"cachedInputTokens":0},"attempts":1,"mode":"object","ms":4672,"keyed_label":"D"}
{"key":"apcalcab-mcq-025","kind":"mcq","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-pro","pass":"solve","ok":true,"object":{"chosen_label":"A","final_answer":"lim(h→0) [f(3+h)−f(3)]/h","working":"The derivative of f at x=3 is defined by f'(3) = lim(h→0) [f(3+h)-f(3)]/h. Choice A matches exactly. Choice C has denominator 3 instead of x-3 and x→3, so it is not the derivative definition. Choice D uses denominator 3 instead of h or x, so it tends to 0 if f is continuous at 3, not f'(3). Choice B also lacks the correct denominator and subtracts f(h), not f(3).","defect":""},"usage":{"inputTokens":459,"inputTokenDetails":{"noCacheTokens":203,"cacheReadTokens":256},"outputTokens":952,"outputTokenDetails":{"textTokens":160,"reasoningTokens":792},"totalTokens":1411,"raw":{"prompt_tokens":459,"completion_tokens":952,"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":256,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":203,"total_tokens":1411,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":256},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":792}},"reasoningTokens":792,"cachedInputTokens":256},"attempts":1,"mode":"object","ms":11637,"keyed_label":"A"}
